<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ALBANIA 2 GERMANY 3 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIA 2 GERMANY 3 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>GRANADA, Spain 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany beat Albania 3-2</p>
<p>in their World Cup European group nine qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Albania: Bledar Kola  61 pen, 90 pen</p>
<p>Germany: Ulf Kirsten 64, 80, 84</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Ukraine		5   4   0   1   6   3  12</p>
<p> Portugal	     6   2   3   1   5   2   9</p>
<p> Germany		4   2   2   0   9   4   8</p>
<p> Northern Ireland   6   1   3   2   5   5   6</p>
<p> Armenia		4   0   3   1   3   7   3</p>
<p> Albania		5   0   1   4   3  10   1</p>
<p>Next matches: April 30 Germany v Ukraine, Armenia v Northern</p>
<p>Irelands</p>
